#: 52028e91e17943269e7516c2cb426620
msgid ""
"Each piece of content is of a kind that not only has one particular job "
"to do, that job is also clearly distinguished from and contrasted with "
"the other functions of documentation."
msgstr ""

#: d564eb5d1e0f4d1395f03b0110963d4f
msgid "Blur"
msgstr ""

#: f2f3e4981c6e4c30acb1d03d4664e745
msgid ""
"Most documentation systems and authors recognise at least some of these "
"distinctions and try to observe them in practice."
msgstr ""

#: 1e0d80d026e449b7be07056aa3ddef94
msgid "Partial collapse of the structure"
msgstr ""

#: 25184ae6042942348498b5598db1f54b
msgid ""
"However, there is a kind of natural affinity between each of the "
"different forms of documentation and its neighbours on the map, and a "
"natural tendency to blur the distinctions (that can be seen repeatedly in"
" examples of documentation)."
msgstr ""

#: d6a6f3a943574d368da4cbc81027429d
msgid "guide action"
msgstr ""

#: 21eb11e3384c42c589a6077c528ef168 d59b4b9013cd4d2cb8e61276335ab689
msgid "tutorials"
msgstr ""

#: 562d44bd8ef44c589760dee801d98f23 fb53c26c7df6495aa2cc92a9fc16679a
msgid "how-to guides"
msgstr ""

#: 99632ceb34ab4d32bc57e3c9f3920401
msgid "serve the application of skill"
msgstr ""

#: 6b5f92d15ce64ecf99d9e4fa8aa01dd6 6d9c3fba0ec94103b89473543d38e675
msgid "reference"
msgstr ""

#: 792a4256858e4afe8e7a66cd4dab2cf6
msgid "contain propositional knowledge"
msgstr ""

#: 75b1ff9f9671448c91fc5d06d643ae59 7cd26c14779b410f95a0c2c9e10fcb82
msgid "explanation"
msgstr ""

#: e71ad00dcfe54e4e919ce6398f75f59a
msgid "serve the acquisition of skill"
msgstr ""

#: 2f633fca0ae64c16999b7cafd667864a
msgid ""
"When these distinctions are allowed to blur, the different kinds of "
"documentation bleed into each other. Writing style and content make their"
" way into inappropriate places. It also causes structural problems, which"
" make it even more difficult to maintain the discipline of appropriate "
"writing."
msgstr ""

#: a37b719e91ab46b284910ff6973f9c39
msgid "Total collapse of the structure"
msgstr ""

#: 7bc13880bf1742c5916207c5eca01428
msgid ""
"In the worst case there is a complete or partial collapse of tutorials "
"and how-to guides into each other, making it impossible to meet the needs"
" served by either."
msgstr ""

#: 5c4a002636ce4c019f8d93cb8a564615
msgid "The journey around the map"
msgstr ""

#: a1d9c7abf1bc4483931ef4259c5335f6
msgid ""
"Diátaxis is intended to help documentation better serve users in their "
"*cycle of interaction* with a product."
msgstr ""

#: 3ee94d7bc2c34546a70ecca1c33c52e8
msgid ""
"This phrase should not be understood too literally. It is not the case "
"that a user must encounter the different kinds of documentation in the "
"order *tutorials* > *how-to guides* > *technical reference* > "
"*explanation*. In practice, an actual user may enter the documentation "
"anywhere in search of guidance on some particular subject, and what they "
"want to read will change from moment to moment as they use your "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

#: b63811b5426d4c38ad32a48bea06ebb7
msgid ""
"However, the idea of a cycle of documentation needs, that proceeds "
"through different phases, is sound and corresponds to the way that people"
" actually do become expert in a craft. There is a sense and meaning to "
"this ordering."
msgstr ""

#: e65f3ef919494c8ebbf819330e029f84
msgid "Moving around the map"
msgstr ""

#: 969f68fc3e284ba8b66697c7882e2fd2
msgid ""
"*learning-oriented phase*: We begin by learning, and learning a skill "
"means diving straight in to do it - under the guidance of a teacher, if "
"we're lucky."
msgstr ""

#: 4486964082ad494ab9964d99c39f0d79
msgid "*goal-oriented phase*: Next we want to put the skill to work."
msgstr ""

#: 6ef1eebee94646c89a44a97aa498862c
msgid ""
"*information-oriented phase*: As soon as our work calls upon knowledge "
"that we don't already have in our head, it requires us to consult "
"technical reference."
msgstr ""

#: 24400e2d1a6c49bcb53aec573b55d8b4
msgid ""
"*explanation-oriented phase*: Finally, away from the work, we reflect on "
"our practice and knowledge to understand the whole."
msgstr ""

#: cdb8e234ab7f4a348880832729e8272d
msgid ""
"And then it's back to the beginning, perhaps for a new thing to grasp, or"
" to penetrate deeper."
msgstr ""

